#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:4 e909ef9b9c284150bbe6ab4df9f5ab7a
msgid "启动应用"
msgstr "Launch applications"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:7 4c648f069d54481f9cda3f88215f3b81
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Goals"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:9 17ff50640162418e8ced52238660e54a
msgid ""
"帮助用户完成平台最常用的科研计算任务——启动交互式应用（如 ``Jupyter Lab``、``Terminal``、``Linux "
"Desktop``、``vscode`` 等）。"
msgstr ""
"Help users with the most common research computing task--launching "
"interactive applications (such as ``Jupyter Lab``, ``Terminal``, ``Linux "
"Desktop``, ``vscode``, etc.)."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:13 d0ab3ec773cc4882b2f3079aeadac10e
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to open"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:15 a1184db4157e440e975cc50975cc6c92
msgid "点击左侧菜单 ``应用列表``，进入应用页面。也可以从工作台 ``快捷操作`` 中的 ``应用管理`` 按钮进入。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``Application List`` in the left menu, or ``Application Management`` "
"under ``Quick Actions`` on the workbench."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:19 6624f061a521491ea24c2f4820fe7332
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page layout"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:21 08fa1a9424af4008bbe32165b128b85e
msgid "页面顶部是 ``用户配额图表``，显示当前账户的 CPU、GPU、内存使用情况 和配额上限。"
msgstr ""
"At the top, ``User Quota Charts`` show CPU, GPU, and memory usage versus "
"limits."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:24 a91986f9d8fe4681aa67c81832a889e7
msgid ""
"页面中部是 ``交互式应用`` 标签页，含应用卡片网格（``Terminal``、 ``Jupyter Lab``、``Linux "
"Desktop``、``vscode`` 等）。当前版本不再单 独提供 ``批处理作业`` 标签，如需在后台运行脚本，请直接使用应用卡片 "
"启动应用并在终端内执行。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Interactive Applications`` tab shows application cards (``Terminal``, "
"``Jupyter Lab``, ``Linux Desktop``, ``vscode``, etc.). There is no separate "
"``Batch Jobs`` tab; to run scripts in the background, start an app from a "
"card and run commands in its terminal."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:29 393cb5ec702d43648d17ded0ecfb6dab
msgid "页面底部是 ``作业列表``，列出当前账号最近产生的作业记录。"
msgstr "At the bottom, ``Job List`` shows recent jobs for your account."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:35 315e5789761c4f38a1d86c23d57c0333
msgid "应用列表"
msgstr "Application list"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:35 5f159743fb6144f39fb052385afe9601
msgid "应用列表页面，含用户配额图表、应用卡片网格（仅有 ``交互式应用`` 标签）和底部作业列表。"
msgstr ""
"Application list with quota charts, the interactive application card grid, "
"and the job list."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:40 332ff002f9fe40329f21547e4d02c6a8
msgid "应用卡片网格"
msgstr "Application card grid"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:42 569711f2dbaa4e37a53251ce7d549cf6
msgid "``交互式应用`` 标签的中部是应用卡片网格。**不同应用的卡片格式略有 不同**："
msgstr ""
"The ``Interactive Applications`` tab centers on the card grid. **Card layout"
" varies slightly by app:**"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:45 156283f2feec46f2a1bb5b337b6f0f28
msgid "``Terminal`` 卡片：只有应用图标、名称和 ``启 动`` 按钮（直接挂接登录节点，无需申请额外资源）。"
msgstr ""
"``Terminal`` cards show only the icon, name, and ``Start`` (attached to the "
"login node; no extra resources)."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:46 4a22f56213a448e1bb8bdd34841ec057
msgid ""
"其他应用卡片（如 ``Jupyter Lab`` ``Linux Desktop`` ``vscode`` ``IceWM`` 等）：包含 "
"``App`` 类型下拉、``N cpus`` 行（选择 CPU 数量）、``M gpus`` 行（选择 GPU 数量，部分应用不支持）、``项目组``"
" 行（选择计费项目组）、``启 动`` / ``关 闭`` 按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Other cards (``Jupyter Lab``, ``Linux Desktop``, ``vscode``, ``IceWM``, "
"etc.) include ``App`` type, ``N cpus``, ``M gpus`` (where supported), "
"``Project Group`` for billing, and ``Start`` / ``Close``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:55 25d6f9b0ef1a4ab3a05e61f785b141e8
msgid "应用卡片和启动按钮"
msgstr "Application cards and Start button"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:55 644571eab9ae46b0a4d390bb1df41367
msgid ""
"应用卡片示例。从左到右：``Terminal``（仅 ``启 动`` 按钮）、 ``Jupyter Lab``、``Linux "
"Desktop``、``vscode``（含 App / cpus / gpus / 项目组选择与 ``启 动`` / ``关 闭`` 按钮）。启动非 "
"Terminal 类应用前，可在卡片的 ``项目组`` 行下拉选择本次任务要计费的项目组， 例如 ``2026 Summer "
"School``；不选择项目组则个人承担相关计费。"
msgstr ""
"Example cards: ``Terminal`` (``Start`` only), ``Jupyter Lab``, ``Linux "
"Desktop``, ``vscode`` (App / cpus / gpus / project group and ``Start`` / "
"``Close``). Before starting non-Terminal apps, pick a billing project group "
"on the card (e.g., ``2026 Summer School``); otherwise charges apply "
"personally."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:62 30063d86b0c94c09ab80fa7a2451366a
msgid "启动流程"
msgstr "Launch workflow"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:64 09046d135ade41d482595a695a4bd2b8
msgid "在左侧菜单点击 ``应用列表``，进入应用页面。"
msgstr ""
"In the left menu, click ``Application List`` to open the application page."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:65 2d03a5a62bf647deba7feca4baedb52a
msgid "在应用卡片网格中找到目标应用（例如 ``Jupyter Lab``）。"
msgstr "Find the target application (e.g., ``Jupyter Lab``) in the grid."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:66 7d24d14253cb4e658825474c513cb0dd
msgid "卡片上如有 CPU/GPU/项目组选择，按任务需要调整（首次使用可直接 使用默认值）。"
msgstr ""
"Adjust CPU/GPU/project group as needed (defaults are fine on first use)."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:68 d6346891212f46189e766eeab958bb50
msgid "点击该卡片上的 ``启 动`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click ``Start`` on that card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:69 5dadb6a217c44b9189c28cd66205cc16
msgid "等待几秒，**浏览器自动弹出新窗口**，新窗口中即为目标应用的交互 界面（如 Jupyter Lab、Linux 远程桌面等）。"
msgstr ""
"Wait a few seconds; **a new window opens** with the interactive UI (Jupyter "
"Lab, Linux desktop, etc.)."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:71 9740509ddfec49eab6bc72e0bcb66cb2
msgid "在新窗口中正常操作即可。结束使用前，请在 ``应用列表`` 页对应卡 片点击 ``关 闭`` 释放资源。"
msgstr ""
"Use the new window as usual. Before finishing, click ``Close`` on the card "
"in ``Application List`` to release resources."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:78 eeec585ec0b64182be00ec32cb895254
msgid "启动后弹出的新窗口"
msgstr "New window after launch"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:78 530c47a3e0c54668933dc4112c06f121
msgid ""
"点击 ``Jupyter Lab`` 卡片的 ``启 动`` 后浏览器自动弹出的 Jupyter Lab 界面。左侧是文件浏览器，右侧是 "
"Notebook 工作区，可以新建文 件、运行命令和编辑代码。"
msgstr ""
"Jupyter Lab after ``Start`` on the card: file browser on the left, Notebook "
"workspace on the right; create files, run commands, and edit code."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:83 ddbb3ccc24f94901a094c7a238fdb742
msgid "关闭应用流程"
msgstr "Close workflow"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:85 e5f962cc29d44946930ccd1e1b35b548
msgid "在 ``应用列表`` 页面找到对应应用卡片。"
msgstr "On ``Application List``, find the application card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:86 f77c67a0ffdb426e94b2e16702e691b1
msgid "点击卡片上的 ``关 闭`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click ``Close`` on the card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:87 a4bec036a6914bcabdc152013b1466a9
msgid "等待几秒，按钮恢复为 ``启 动``，对应作业状态变为 ``已关闭`` 或 ``已完成``。"
msgstr ""
"After a few seconds the button returns to ``Start``; job status becomes "
"``Closed`` or ``Completed``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:91 d9af6e9712604c509d27445aba239005
msgid "作业列表（应用启动后产生的作业）"
msgstr "Job list (jobs created by launched apps)"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:93 f0ec1818551f4833a600813373cda4d1
msgid ""
"``应用列表`` 页面底部的 ``作业列表`` 表格列包含：``作业ID``、``作业名称``、 "
"``用户``、``分区``、``CPUS``、``GPUS``、``状态``、``耗时``、``节点数量``、 ``操作``。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Job List`` table columns include ``Job ID``, ``Job Name``, ``User``, "
"``Partition``, ``CPUS``, ``GPUS``, ``Status``, ``Duration``, ``Node Count``,"
" and ``Actions``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:101 e049172769724b98a7a4c11a7895aaef
msgid "作业列表"
msgstr "Job list"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:101 3ab5905f7f47462d8b2212833dbf8004
msgid "``作业列表`` 显示当前用户的最近作业记录。"
msgstr "``Job List`` shows recent jobs for the current user."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:103 24001e61977a44d5a90d221640fc0f2c
msgid "常见状态说明（仅解释普通用户最常见状态）："
msgstr "Common statuses (for typical users):"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:105 e68b4e5d0a494187a887d853733060b5
msgid "``运行中``：作业正在执行。"
msgstr "``Running``: the job is active."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:106 31d753aacca14a5781028d0ac9ded452
msgid "``排队中``：作业等待资源。"
msgstr "``Queued``: waiting for resources."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:107 2fd6d70b4bc945ec88bf2fee81cfcc80
msgid "``已完成``：作业执行结束。"
msgstr "``Completed``: finished successfully."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:108 4c436b5ce2544e74bdac24448e349e5c
msgid "``失败``：作业未成功。"
msgstr "``Failed``: did not succeed."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:109 bf86ddb6754a44b3bdbbc1ec261e7e1d
msgid "``已取消``：作业被用户或管理员取消。"
msgstr "``Cancelled``: canceled by user or administrator."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:112 ef42fe1fae1941198185ce9c64a15166
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:116 bf3cc33862a94edc9c4a738ce9b5f457
msgid "启动应用会占用集群资源。CPU、GPU 和项目组选择应与任务规模相匹 配；不确定时使用默认或最小可用配置即可。"
msgstr ""
"Launching apps consumes cluster resources. Match CPU/GPU/project group to "
"workload; use defaults or minimum settings when unsure."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:118 f520ba2e331f430295510bfc9487003b
msgid "使用结束后请主动 ``关 闭`` 应用，避免持续占用资源。"
msgstr "``Close`` apps when done to avoid holding resources."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:119 55a13671d94f4bc8ba2f6d3091513b2e
msgid ""
"关闭浏览器窗口不一定等同停止应用，必须回到 ``应用列表`` 页面点 击 ``关 闭`` 才能释放资源（弹出的应用窗口是会话窗口，关闭后后 "
"端进程仍可能继续运行）。"
msgstr ""
"Closing the browser window may not stop the app; use ``Close`` on "
"``Application List`` (the popup is a session window; backend processes may "
"keep running)."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:122 3abdc2d56b2c4d5fb0f0bd56c0eb6b97
msgid "当前版本不再单独提供 ``批处理作业`` 标签；如需在后台运行脚 本，请启动 Terminal/Jupyter 等应用后在其中执行。"
msgstr ""
"There is no separate ``Batch Jobs`` tab; run scripts in Terminal/Jupyter "
"after launching."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:126 c0a1682f6df54659ad2443fbe1ae333b
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:128 42a588bbcd7340aca389a06a431254ff
msgid ""
"**应用点击 ``启 动`` 后没有弹出新窗口怎么办？** 检查浏览器是否拦截了弹窗（通常浏览器地址栏右侧会有弹窗拦截提示， 允许弹窗后再次点击 ``启"
" 动``）。如已允许弹窗仍无反应，等待 10～ 30 秒后在 ``作业列表`` 中查看对应作业状态。"
msgstr ""
"**No popup after ``Start``?** Check whether the browser blocked pop-ups "
"(look for a blocker icon near the address bar), allow pop-ups, and click "
"``Start`` again. If still nothing, wait 10-30 seconds and check job status "
"in ``Job List``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:133 619e456bb3484ffd9a86a0584559c685
msgid "**如何确认应用已经启动？** 浏览器已弹出新窗口，且 ``应用列表`` 页面底部 ``作业列表`` 中对应 作业状态为 ``运行中``。"
msgstr ""
"**How to confirm the app started?** A new browser window opened and the job "
"in ``Job List`` shows ``Running``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/applications.rst:137 6ef371b6128148bd8afd791d40eac17f
msgid ""
"**为什么 Terminal 卡片没有 CPU/GPU 选项？** Terminal 直接挂接登录节点，无需申请额外资源。点击 ``启 动`` 后浏览 "
"器弹出新窗口即可使用。"
msgstr ""
"**Why no CPU/GPU on Terminal?** Terminal uses the login node directly; click"
" ``Start`` and use the new window."
